{
 "read": "Lv.99 characters after Reset Stats with no gear, cards or Extra, Auto off. Stats tab preview: + / +10 pressed and the green deltas read off the right panel, then Clear; nothing confirmed",
 "notes": [
  "every stat starts at 1; \"bonus\" is the blue number beside each stat (still there with nothing equipped)",
  "sweeps: the panel delta with that one stat raised from 1 to each value in \"at\" (bonus not counted), the others at 1",
  "class passives stay on with no gear (Skills tab), so they are in these numbers; a passive that adds a stat (Archer Hunter's Focus DEX +10) shows in that stat's bonus"
 ],
 "findings": [
  "nothing else moves: AGI does not change Evasion, VIT not DEF, INT not MDEF, and no stat moves a special stat",
  "stats add up: AGI 99 with DEX swept gives each alone summed; four stats at 50 give their single sweeps summed",
  "ATK: the main stat (STR for Samurai and Thief, DEX for the Archer) follows one growing curve, about 1.3 raw ATK per point at first and 3.7 near 99; the Archer's DEX adds 0.56 per point on top. Everything is times the class ATK% passive: Samurai x1.15 (Katana Mastery), Thief x1.20 (Killer Instinct), Archer x1.22 (Hunter's Focus). The other stats add about 0.21 raw ATK per point (DEX and LUK for melee, STR and LUK for the Archer)",
  "ASPD: AGI 99 shrinks the gap to 200 by 45% for every class and DEX 99 by 11%; the gap with all stats at 1 is Samurai 40, Thief 34, Archer 58",
  "Crit Rate = about 7.5 + k x (LUK + bonus) + passives: k is 0.3 for Samurai and Archer, 0.6 for Thief; Samurai adds Katana Mastery CRIT +20",
  "Max HP per VIT: 31.2 for Samurai and Thief, 23.3 for the Archer; HP Regen about 0.35 per VIT",
  "Cast Speed follows total DEX (stat + bonus) on one falling curve: the Samurai at DEX 44 has the Archer's base 38.4%",
  "Crit DMG starts at +50% (Samurai +60 with Lingering Edge, Thief +70 with Killer Instinct); Evasion starts at 132 for Samurai and Thief before Swift Step +15 / Light Step +20 (Archer 125); Move Speed +4% (Light Step +15%)",
  "INT is the same for all three: Max SP +4.06 per point, MATK growing (1.8 then 11.4 per point)"
 ],
