 "formulas": {
  "note": "Ragnarok Online formulas fit all six classes measured (Samurai, Thief, Archer, Cleric, Merchant, Swordsman) to the point. Every stat counts with its blue bonus, which includes stats from passives (Heavy Lifter STR +10, Hunter's Focus DEX +10); floor = round down",
  "ATK": "(MAIN + floor(MAIN/10)^2 + floor(A/5) + floor(LUK/5)) x (1 + class ATK%) x about 1.025. MAIN is STR and A is DEX for melee; for a bow MAIN is DEX and A is STR. ATK% adds up: Katana Mastery 15, Killer Instinct 20, Hunter's Focus 20, Devotion 20, Heavy Lifter 20, Blade Training 20 (melee), and an Extra counts in full (the Cleric with Hunter's Focus: 1.40). The Samurai also adds 15% of AGI (Lingering Edge)",
  "MATK": "(INT + floor(INT/5)^2) x (1 + MATK%) x about 1.03 (Devotion MATK +20%)",
  "ASPD": "200 - W x (1 - AGI/250 - DEX/1000), within 0.3. W per class with its passives and Extras: Thief 39.7, Samurai 46.7, Swordsman 48.7, Cleric 55.2 (with Swift Step as an Extra), Archer 68.1, Merchant 77.3; attack speed % shrinks W. Cap 190",
  "Crit Rate": "7.2 to 7.7 + k x LUK + CRIT from passives, k = 0.3 (Thief 0.6). Samurai: Katana Mastery CRIT +20",
